## About MSB

Until its closure, MSB was the authority responsible for civil protection, preparedness and cybersecurity supervision in Sweden. It issued regulations on information security and led the Swedish NIS2 implementation work.

## Successor

Its work has been taken over by Myndigheten för civilt försvar (MCF), which now exercises supervision and coordination in this area.
